  "fullContentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Sachivalaya Syllabus 2023</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Reporter:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">For direct recruitment to the posts of Reporter, there will be three stages of test/ examination:-</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Preliminary Examination (OMR - Answer Sheet Based Multiple Choice Objective Test)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Hindi Stenography Test and Hindi and English typing (Computer Based) Test and MS Office Word Processing (Computer Based) Test and</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Interview</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Assistant:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">For direct recruitment to the posts of Assistant, the test/ examination will be conducted in three phases -</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Preliminary Examination (OMR Answer Sheet Based Multiple Choice Objective Test)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Hindi &amp; English typing (Computer Based) Test and MS Office Word Processing (Computer Based) Test</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Main Examination (Descriptive)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Assistant Catetaker:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Test/ Examination will be conducted in three phases for direct recruitment to the posts of Assistant Catetaker-</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Preliminary Examination (OMR Answer Sheet Based Multiple Choice Objective Test)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">MS Office Word Processing (Computer Based) Test</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Main Examination (Descriptive)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Date Entry Operator (DEO):-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Test/ Examination will be conducted in two phases for direct recruitment to the posts of Date Entry Operator-</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Preliminary Examination (OMR Answer Sheet Based Multiple Choice Objective Test)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Hindi &amp; English typing (Computer Based) Test and MS Office Word Processing (Computer Based) Test</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Main Examination (Descriptive)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Lower Division Clerk (LDC):-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Test/ Examination will be conducted in two phases for direct recruitment to the posts of Date Entry Operator-</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Preliminary Examination (OMR Answer Sheet Based Multiple Choice Objective Test)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Hindi &amp; English typing (Computer Based) Test and MS Office Word Processing (Computer Based) Test</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Main Examination (Descriptive)</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Security Guard:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">For direct recruitment to the posts of Security Guard, the test/ examination will be conducted in two stages - (1) Physical Measurement Test and Physical Eligibility Test (RFID based race) and (2) Interview.</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol type=\"a\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Physical Eligibility Test will be of 50 marks and Interview will be of 50 marks.</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">A candidate who does not fulfill the minimum prescribed criteria in the running event will be declared unsuccessful.</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Security Driver:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">For direct recruitment to the post of Driver, test/examination will be conducted in two stages (1) Driving skill and practical (trade test) test and (2) Interview.</span></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol type=\"a\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Driving skill and practical (trade test) test (75 marks) and interview (25 marks) will be taken for direct recruitment to the posts of driver, total score of 100 marks.</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Candidates declared unsuccessful in driving skill and practical (trade test) test will not be eligible for direct recruitment to the posts of driver. No preference will be given for higher educational qualification.</span></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><u>Office Attendant:-</u></h3>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Method of Examination - The method of direct recruitment to these posts will be through separate interviews.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t",
